Minibus
This vehicle well fit perfectly into your project if you need a limited number of polygons.
Advantages:

  - wide selection of formats; 

  - a limited number of polygons; 

  - materials avaliable;

  - game ready.

Limitations:

  - lack of texture;

  - low quality mesh.

If you notice incorrect display of mesh in any of the formats, write me, I will try to fix it.

14 3d sci fi piecesI made it using blender 3.2some pieces are overlapping objects a joined without boolean operation.all object  smooth with auto smooth 30 degree 
the 3d plane with grid material is not included 
type of files:{stl ,obj ,gltf ,fbx}

The object is modeled in the environment Autodesk Inventor 2018. 
To create a photo renderer, use Inventor Studio. 

The model contains the most popular formats: 
.max; 
.fbx; 
.dwg; 
.stp; 
.obj; 
.stl; 
.igs; 
and more.
The model contains the most popular formats. Each file was checked for opening and full content by the model.
Thank you for coming to see this model. Also pay attention to other models by clicking on the name of the account in the right corner.
